WEBVTT

00:00:06.297 --> 00:00:07.017
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:08.090 --> 00:00:10.439
<v><b>A:</b></v> Are you going to Shanghai in the spring?

00:00:10.830 --> 00:00:13.095
<v><b>B:</b></v> No, we’re going in the autumn.

00:00:15.210 --> 00:00:15.938
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:16.859 --> 00:00:18.612
<v><b>A:</b></v> Is this a new carpet?

00:00:19.010 --> 00:00:20.926
<v><b>B:</b></v> No, we’ve had it cleaned.

00:00:22.991 --> 00:00:23.793
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:24.751 --> 00:00:27.676
<v><b>A:</b></v> Did you say you were going to the hairdresser’s this afternoon?

00:00:27.874 --> 00:00:30.062
<v><b>B:</b></v> No, I’m going to the dentist’s.

00:00:32.116 --> 00:00:32.853
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:33.969 --> 00:00:36.999
<v><b>A:</b></v> What a well-behaved dog! What’s his name?

00:00:37.799 --> 00:00:40.727
<v><b>B:</b></v> What’s her name, actually. She’s called Luna.

00:00:42.864 --> 00:00:43.723
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:00:44.644 --> 00:00:47.533
<v><b>A:</b></v> Is that your nephew, the one who’s a lawyer?

00:00:48.079 --> 00:00:51.086
<v><b>B:</b></v> He’s a judge, actually. And yes, that’s him.

00:00:53.248 --> 00:00:54.068
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 6

00:00:55.229 --> 00:00:57.257
<v><b>A:</b></v> Oh dear. Did you fall off your bike?

00:00:57.707 --> 00:01:00.806
<v><b>B:</b></v> No, I was knocked off my bike by a car.